= Sol Rally =
Solana-Powered Kart Racing
- Version $STKVERSION$
- Entry fees in, payouts out — 50/30/20 on Solana devnet
- Built on SuperTuxKart, reimagined for the Solana ecosystem

= Sol Rally Team =
Design, engineering and on-chain escrow
- Race modes: Mainnet Race, Slot Sprint, MEV Battle
- Grand Prix settlement via Anchor escrow program

= Powered By =
Solana, Anchor, MagicBlock (planned), Emscripten and WebAssembly
- Solana devnet for entry fees and winner payouts
- Anchor framework for the on-chain escrow program
- Emscripten and WebAssembly for browser play

= Open Source =
Sol Rally builds on the SuperTuxKart open-source project
- SuperTuxKart is released under GPL 3.0
- Its assets are released under Creative Commons and other licenses
- Thank you to the SuperTuxKart contributors
